      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_WEST_ROD_05",
      "WaitClick": false,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "CutsceneClear": "CLEARUNIT",
      "UnitStrId": "NPC_MODULE_OBSERVER_FEMALE_1",
      "CameraOffset": "TWIN_6"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 72,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_WEST_ROD_05",
      "WaitClick": false,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_WEST_ROD",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_REST_START"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 73,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_WEST_ROD_05",
      "WaitClick": false,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "TransitionEffect": "WIPE",
      "TransitionControl": "OUT"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 74,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_WEST_ROD_05",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_WEST_ROD",
      "EmotionEffect": "THINK2",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…역시. ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "やっぱり… ",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 75,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_WEST_ROD_05",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_WEST_ROD",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이상하죠? ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "おかしいですよね？ ",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 76,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_WEST_ROD_05",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "어떤 부분이?",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "何が？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 77,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_WEST_ROD_05",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_WEST_ROD",
      "UnitMotion": "ANGRY",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아잇, 다시 한번 생각해보세요 단장님. ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "もぉ～。よく考えてみてくださいよ、団長さん？ ",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 78,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_WEST_ROD_05",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_WEST_ROD",
      "CameraOffset": "ONE_3",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "만약 그 관측사의 말이 사실이라고 해도…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "もしあの観測士の言葉が本当だったとしても…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 79,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_WEST_ROD_05",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_WEST_ROD",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "기껏해야 이름도 알려지지 않은 작은 광산에서 일어난 사고에요. ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "有名でもない、小さな鉱山で起こった事故です。 ",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 80,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_WEST_ROD_05",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_WEST_ROD",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그런 곳에 관심을 조금 가졌다고 궤도 수색대의 관측사가 직접 찾아와서 경고를?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そんな場所に興味を持ったからって、軌道捜索隊の観測士が直々に警告をしに来ると思いますか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 81,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_WEST_ROD_05",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_WEST_ROD",
      "UnitMotion": "SAD",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "뭔가… 있는 것 같지 않나요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "何か…あると思いません？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 82,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_WEST_ROD_05",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "생각해보니까 그렇네.",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "よく考えてみたら、そうだな。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 83,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_WEST_ROD_05",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_WEST_ROD",
